      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>A white winged creature with ram horns and a large jaw of sharp teeth.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 23, touch 15; flat-footed 17 (+5 Dex, +1 dodge, +8 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 150 [204] (12d10+84)</p><p>Fort +15, Ref +13, Will +10</p><p>DR 10/evil; Immune Bleed, Death Effects, Holy, Mind-affecting, Outsider traits, Petrification/Statue, Stun; Resist Lightning 10, Shadow 10, Fire 10; SR 20;</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft., Fly 50 ft. (good)</p><p>Melee Bite +18 (2d6+7), 2 Wings +13 (1d6+3)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 5 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Flying Leap, Ram, Shriek</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 24, Dex 20, Con 24, Int 10, Wis 18, Cha 12</p><p>Base Atk +12; CMB +20; CMD 36</p><p>Feats Dodge, Improved Initiative, Iron Will, Power Attack, Skill Focus (Perception), Weapon Focus (Bite)</p><p>Skills Diplomacy +11, Fly +16, Intimidate +11, Knowledge (planes) +10, Knowledge (religion) +10, Perception +19, Sense Motive +14; Racial Modifiers +4 Perception;</p><p>Languages Celestial</p>"
      }
